💬 Merge Sort in EmojiLang

⚙️ merge(left, right) {
🔢 result = 📦[]
🔢 i = 0
🔢 j = 0
🔁 i < 📏(left) && j < 📏(right) {
🤔 🔍(left, i) <= 🔍(right, j) {
📥 result = 📦[🔍(left, i)]
i = i + 1
}
😢 {
📥 result = 📦[🔍(right, j)]
j = j + 1
}
}

🔁 i < 📏(left) {
📥 result = 📦[🔍(left, i)]
i = i + 1
}

🔁 j < 📏(right) {
📥 result = 📦[🔍(right, j)]
j = j + 1
}

↩️ result
}

⚙️ merge_sort(arr) {
🤔 📏(arr) <= 1 {
↩️ arr
}

🔢 mid = 📏(arr) / 2
🔢 left = merge_sort(✂️(arr, 0, mid))
🔢 right = merge_sort(✂️(arr, mid, 📏(arr)))
↩️ merge(left, right)
}

💬 Main program
🔢 data = 📦[38, 27, 43, 3, 9, 82, 10]
🔢 sorted = merge_sort(data)
📢 sorted
